5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need to stop guessing. I want to know exactly how many bikes leave between seven and nine, and where the rain hits.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to verify the actual costs. I’ll check the building ledger and the station park fees to see what we’re really paying.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I suspect the current arrangement is just habit, not fairness. I’ll review the five years of minutes and the sticker register to see who actually holds the spaces.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m checking the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account. I want to see how this arrangement actually breaks down before we make it worse.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
