36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: The ledger shows capital work needs a levy. The station park costs 2,600 yen monthly, with fourteen households already waiting.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,- **George**: The minutes confirm the same flats held covered spots for five years without review. The sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying over equal claims.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,- **Shunichi**: The complaint log has nine unresolved notes. The neighbor’s block saw two households stop attending meetings after a monthly charge.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: The treasurer spends three hours monthly on cash. The frame takes twenty seconds to load and needs greasing twice a year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: Eleven bikes leave between seven and nine, and four mornings required shifting another machine. The row under the eaves stays dry, but past the downpipe, saddles remain wet.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Asuka, the shifting confirms the bottleneck. But the ledger shows no capital funds, so any new structure requires a levy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"- **George**: @Ryuji, the ledger is one thing, but the minutes prove the current holders never faced a review. We need to address that inertia.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, the neighbor’s block shows that charges create arrears and silence. We risk the same social fracture here if we push too hard.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"-Mio: @Shunichi, the neighbor’s silence is a warning, but the frame’s twenty-second load is manageable. I can handle the greasing if we split the duty.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Mio, splitting the greasing duty is fine, but the morning bottleneck is the real crisis. We need a system that stops the shoving.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the bottleneck is real, but the ledger shows no capital funds. Any new structure requires a levy, which the station park comparison makes difficult.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the ledger is empty, but the sticker register shows daily riders would pay. We can fund the levy without a capital project.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, willingness to pay isn’t the same as ability to pay. The neighbor’s block proves that charges create arrears and silence, not just revenue.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I hear the warning, but the frame trial proved the physical load is light. I can manage the greasing if we rotate it fairly.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Ryuji, the rain data proves the covered spots are the only viable option. We must protect them, not just count the bikes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
