70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Mio, the frame trial is irrelevant if we choose the lottery. I need to know if you support the paid option to secure the covered spots.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the paid option requires a levy. The ledger is empty, and the station park’s fourteen waiters prove external demand is high. I cannot support a cost we cannot verify.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"- **George**: @Ryuji, the sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying. That revenue covers the levy, so the ledger’s emptiness is not a barrier.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
