76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, I cannot support a levy with an empty ledger. The station park’s fourteen waiters prove external demand is high. I cannot verify the cost.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
